lyrics:
Ia roh pe hamateian, Jesus do mangapoh au.
Roh pe ari paruhuman, Jesus mangkahui au;
Aha be habiaranku? Jesus hatundalankin;
Ai ma ase pujionku holong ni atei-Ni in.

In ma Tuhan Jesus in; Sipaluah manisia;
Itadingkon surga in, ase gabe jolma Ia .
Durus do daroh-Ni in, ase sasap dousa in.

Tangar nasiam ganup, ganupan na pusok uhur;
Seng anjai tarbuang be, halak na martenger uhur.
Bai Tuhanta Jesus in, na mangkopkop haganup.

Sai urupi au Tuhanku manipat sadari on .
Bogei Ham pangindoanku songon na pinungkahkon;
Sai huhasiholi ma minggu-Mu , o Naibata,

Seng ipindo uhur-Ni ijon sangap-Ni in;
I surga paratas-Ni, harajaon-Ni in.
Ai tarponop ope i tanoh on tunggung-Ni;
Dob das ganup horja-Ni talar ma in use.

Hosianna! Torih ma hanai na nirajaan-Mu.
Togu ma bai Naibata, hang ganup susian-Mu;
Sai papuho hanai on, mangiahon hata-Mu.

Panondang on ma patidakkon na songga niidahta in.
Halani ai sai hagoluhkon sondang-Ni in bai tonduymin;
Ai in do hasonanganmin, age pe hansur na dong in.

Usih songon dagingku Ham, Naibata hinan;
Bamu au sol mardomu, Ham artangkin nuan.
Nai ma, naima, Ham artangkin nuan.

Haganup pardousa pe seng tarbuang be hape;
Ipaluah Jesus hita humbai haganup dousanta.
‘Ge na golap in hape, ipalihar Jesus do.

Napuji ma homani, ‘par holong atei in;
Ibere do Anak-Ni hagoluhanta in.
Megah ma hita on mamuji Naibatanta ibaen layak-Ni in

Iudut Ham do hosahkin paidah-idah ahu,
Atap na dong do buah ni horja-Mu in hu bangku;
Hape gati hiranan Ham: Buah ni in seng jumpah Ham

Ra ma manringis Naibata mangidah parlahouhu;
Ra ihatahon: “Roboh ma haron na so behangku;
Seng ongga ra marbuah in, benaha be marguna in!”

Halani kinahuhon-Mu do au, ase manggoloh;
Sonon nimu bai Bapa-Mu: Paturut ma manggoloh;
Haron, holong ma atei-Mu, taun roh pe das uhum-Mu.

Na binahen-Mu ganup pagoluhkon tonduynami,
Huatuahon pe sungkup, sol gomos jolomonnami;
‘Ge bai tahun baru on, gok Bamu hanami on.

Sai marhasomankon ham ma hanami lao mardalan,
Bintang pambobai do Ham, sai tongtong bai pardalanan;
Binaen ni sondang-Mu in gabe lihar dalan in.

Na ponop na dokahni uhur ni Tuhanta in;
Seng ibotoh tinornpa-Ni dalan hagoluhan in;
Ai na kahou do jojor bani dalan na seor.

Salpu do nuan bornginni, binsar do panondang in;
Domma roh haliharon-Ni bani ganup jolma in.
Sai maluah nasiam humbai golap nasiam.

Omas bereonku Ham, in ma haporsayaonku;
Ai na dob isuan Ham in hu bangku baen ugasku.
Sai pitah ma omaskin ’ge bai sitarononkin.

Tuhan Jesus do Rajanta na manggomgom haganup;
Pinarorot ni Tuhanta na marhosah haganup.
Anggo lao hata-Ni in, seng tarbaen lang saud in;
Sai na saud do hata-Ni bai ganup manisia-Ni.

Domma roh na mangapohi kalak parsinumbah in;
Ondos nuan na jengesni bai na mangakuhon in;
Tuhan Jesus Raja in, na dob roh hun surga in,
Sai Tuhanta ma napuji, nairikkon ma hata-Ni

O Jesusku, pagolpa ahu bai dousangku, hu Bamu;
Sanggah bai na golap ope ahu, sai lumbang do uhur-Mu.
Ai dokah Ham mangindahi ahu, ase ulang magou au na kahou;
Ham manaron marsik in, lao manobus tonduyhin.

Na galek i tanoh on sai margogoh do magira.
Na masombuh in ijon, sai marsangap do magira;
Partonduyon do use, daging on ijin hape.

Bere Ham bai uhurnami hapentaran hun Bamu.
Ase ibotoh hanami marpangabak hu Bamu;
Humbai hakahouon pe Ham ma paluahkon bei.

Patuduhkon Ham bannami dalan hagoluhan in;
Sai pabayu uhurnami, sai padaoh dousa in.
Sai pagogoh au tongtong bani na madear on.

Jalo ma parroh-Ni ai holong atei-Ni roh hu banta on;
Ase sondangan-Ni siang bahenon-Ni paruhuron tong.
Sai jalohon Ia da ase lao ganup holsohmu `ge sitarononmu.

Ai anggo hiou ni tonduyhu, daroh ni Tuhan Jesus do;
In do binere ni Tuhanku manguras ahu pakon ho
Malas uhurhu halanin sadokah ni dokahni in.

Maraloling hata on tong ibagas uhurnami;
Barang ise na ijon ningon tubuh dua hali
Tubuh ampakon hum babou ase ulang dong be magou

Ai sadokah au ijon, barang rotap hosahkon.
Lao dohor pe ajalhin, bani paruhuman in;
Batu gingging Ham tongon, sai Bamu rna tonduyhon.

Na monang ini do bereon-Ku mangan, i surga, manna na ponop ope;
ai parlahouni do tongtong ingaton, margoran na bayu homa use;
na sinuratkon bai batu intan, tongtong martuah sijalo in.
tongtong martuah sijalo in.

Na monang in mangidah pambahenan-Ku, in ma na marmahani bangsa in;
Ai huondososkon deba kuasang-Ku, bai tangan ni ganup na monang in;
Sai ropukon-Ni ijin imbang-Ni, patundukon-Ni do musuhkin.
patundukon-Ni do musuhkin.

Na martuah nini Jesus, na sombuh tonduyni in;
Ai langkahni do na torus hu nagori atas in.
Sai na sonang uhurni na manggolom Hata in.

Na marhoru pe tarbahen gabe sonang uhurnin;
Ai horuni in mabahen roh na mangapohi in.
Sai na sonang uhurni ganup na iapoh in.

Na martuah hataonkon na lamlam maruhur in;
Ai sidea do manean ganup na i tanoh in.
Sai na sonang uhur ni na mangampog ringis in.

Binsar ma , binsar ma, marsinondang ma;
haliharon ran hun babou, lao pagoluh na itanoh;
hanai on ganup, hanai on ganup.

Ulang maseda hajolmaon, ninuhur ni Jahowa in;
Isuruh do bai hajolmaon, Anakni Sipagoluh in.
Sai ihartuki Hata-Niin do labah ni uhurta in.

Sai timbang ma holong-Ni in hubam pardousa in;
Papakei pangkopkop-Ni in na patandahon in.
Ai pe paubah uhurmin, tangihon Jesus in;
Sai hagigihon dousamin, ‘ge hadorsaonmin,
ge hadorsaonmin.

Ai seng be dong na songon Ham Tuhanku,
na parlunggarhon pusok ni uhurhu;
Sahalak Ham do sipasonang ahu, hagoluhanku.

Simole-ole songon sanggar hasoman na i tanoh on;
Tongtong do Jesus na tarsulur, huan-Ni pe jonam tongtong.
Ai pe baen hita Jesus in tongtong huan-huanta in.

Sai marpangkaut do hasoman bai holong ni atei ni in;
Hapeni anggo seng dapotan, sai sirang do parsaoran nin.
Ai pe baen hita Jesus in tongtong huan-huanta in.

Sai humpit hita do uhur-Ni, sintong do parsaoran-Ni in;
Manongtong holong ni atei-Ni bai ganup niain-Ni in.
Ai pe baen hita Jesus in tongtong huan-huanta in.

Ai anak-Mu do mangajarhon bannami hata pangindoan in;
Buei do na mangkaringgaskon lao mangkorjahon na nidok-Ni in,
Halani ai, tangihon Ham ma in, Nimu lah Amen saud ma Hata in.

Sai bahen Ham doras mardalan hu sab dunia on ambilan-Mu .
Sai bahen Ham marhulan-hulan, halak na masuk hu Kuria-Mu;
Puhoi pakon Israel ganup, ‘se mulak use hu Kuria-Mu ,

Pauli Sion na marumbak, padaoh Ham na mangambat hata-Mu ;
O Tuhan, roh ma Ham manumpak horja ni haganup jabolon-Mu.
Sai tong pansing ma pohon anggur-Mu, ase ibere buah hu Bamu .

Holong ateimu Tuhan Naibata,
pasaud hata-Mu tumpaki homa;
haganupan horja ni jabolon -Mu;
Martuah homa ma baen Ham jolma on!

Ai Jesus do padamei ho na loja in tongtong;
Ai anggo lang hujin ho roh, manaron ma ho tong.
Halani in, sai roh ma ho.

Sai tong tenger uhurrnu mardingat Tuhan in;
Lupahon rna uhurmu bai pandoleian in ;
Ai anggo itahankon horu ni uhurmin.
Tarolos do Tuhanta mambuat horumin .

Sai tong tenger uhurrnu mardingat Tuhan in;
Lupahon rna uhurmu bai pandoleian in ;
Ai anggo itahanko n horu ni uhurmin.
Tarolos do Tuhanta mambuat horumin .

Sai pahamot Naibata, dousamin pe imbang ma!
Ulang habiari talu, hamonangan do rupeimu;
Ipasaud Naibatamin na pinarbagah-Ni in.

Anggo rapkon Jesus in, seng dong hamagouan;
Pandei pe sibolis in, Jesus sigogohan;
Asal ipanalom ho Jesus in Tuhanmu,
Ningon sai maporus do na hinoruhon-Mu.

Ham ma marmahan hanami na i halungunan,
Ase tarbaen hu lambung-Mu marpesta o Tuhan;
Togu ham tong, hanai na loja ijon, das ronsi bai parsaranan.

Sai papansing ham uhurhu ampa sanggah modom au;
Layak-Mu baen Ham sabingku, suruh na manjaga au;
Ham pamiloh apuy in ‘pa manjaga rumah in,
Ulang tangis da hanami patar dob puho hanami.

Hupuji Ham, o Naibatangku, tarima kasih ma Bamu,
Ibaen pambere-Mu ganupan hubangku, ai hubotoh do;
Megah do Ham bai dodingkin, marhitei-hitei Jesus in.

Nuan adong pangiondoanku, na porlu sibereon-Mu;
Sai ulang dingat ham dousangku, holong ma Ham manguras au,
Marhitei-hitei daroh in na dob manggalar utangkin.

Seng mubah hata-Mu hubangku, totap do bagah-bagah-Mu;
Ai pagoluhon-Mu pardousa, anggo marhoru uhurnin.
Janah iboan dousa in bai Jesus, Sipaluah in.

In ma ginolom ni uhurhu bani haporsayaonkin.
Ase malas nuan uhurhu lao paujungkon minggu in;
Ai domma sonang uhurhin ibaen pangarapanni in.

Dob-dob hinan ma lah hupuji na sihol bereon-Mu,
hubotoh do pangkaholongi ni Ham age hupudi on;
Hu surga au itogu Ham, sonin ipingkir Ham hinan.

Ham do na marianan bai uhurhon, o Tuhan,
Sonang ma au nuan marayak podomanku;
Ai sasap ma dousangku, sabingku layak-Mu hubaen.

Sai nagori atas do situjuaon ni uhurta;
Ai na manginsolat do hita i nagori tongah.
Pardagangan tanoh on, surga hasusuranta in.

Jesus mangkatahon au: “Sai tujui ma dompak babou”.
Ulang lambin sirang au humbai hasusuran, kahou;
Ia tong hudingat in, das ma au use hujin.

Sai hu babou laho au, hamateian do hiteihu;
Ase lalab sirang au humbani pusok ni uhurhu.
Jesus do hunlobei lao, gabe megah lao ma au.

Surga in na mando tong na porlu bani tonduyhu;
Rotaponku ma tongtong rosuh-rosuh ni dagingku.
Surga do tujuankin, rosni ondos au hujin.

Ai pe lang be tahanonku uhur ni Naibatakin;
Huberehon pe hosahku, lang be pusok uhurhin.
Ai bai ugah ni Jesusku dapot au hagoluhanku;
Ibaen parmatei-Ni in do tarapoh uhurhin.

Lao ma au, lao ma au bai Jesusku na madaoh.
Ai masihol do uhurhu, mangayaki Naibatangku;
Ase ilambung-Ni au, ase ilambung-Ni au.

Ai roh do ham magira mangidah au i surga, marhiou na lopak,
marrudang hagoluhan mamahei hamonangan;
ijin ma use in talar.

Ise do ganup sidea i lambung ni Naibata;
Marsotali do hudidah marsinalsal do homa.
Ganup do mandoding bei sai riap mamuji bei.

Na maparngit, tinaronni, sanggah na i tanoh on;
Na sombuh na sain dokahni, gabe hasangapon do.
In do rupei nin nuan, malas uhurnin ibaen.

Na mandoding do sidea pasangapkon Jesus in;
Na tangkas ijin ididah sintong ni Hata-Ni in.
Na pinarbagah-Ni in, ondos do ganupan in.

Seng be hona bai sidea sambor ni dunia on;
Seng be dong ijin taridah sisunsahi hita on;
‘Ge ganup dousanta pe, seng dingaton be hape.

Horah, lohei, ampa loja, ‘ge borgoh ni ari in.
Porkas, longgur, haba-haba, udan, milas ari in;
Uhum bani dousa in, seng be hona in hujin.

Ai bai Naibata sidea, si pasabaou uhur in;
Jesus do tongtong ididah i nagori atas in;
Hatuahon do ijin sadokah-dokahni in.

Marsaran mando hape hita i lambung ni Tuhanta in;
Mardamei janah sonang hita tongtong bai ianan-Ni in.
Padoras hita ma langkahta, mangayak rumahni Tuhanta,
Lang bulih lolei hita on;
Sai eta hita ‘le, hasoman marlintun hu hamonangan,
dohor do hasonangan in.

Barah ma roh Tuhanta marjaga nasiam;
Tangihon golpa-golpa, na dob ibogei ham!
Melele siang ari, lao ma na golap in;
Dohor ma panorangni, lihar ma ari in.

Ibahen Ham do pardearan, salosei dousa in ganup;
In do mangkorhon haluahon bani parjahat ganup.
Ai pe tarima kasih, au on Bamu, o Naibata

Tarima kasih ma uhurhu ibahen bagah-bagah in;
Seng rotap holong-Mu hubangku age ronsi antigan in.
Toguh do padan-Mu ijin, age pe seda tanoh in.

Ale Tuhan Bapanami na marholong atei in;
Sai pasorap Ham bannami Tonduymu Napansing in.
Tonggor au, tonggor au Tonduy-Mu sai bere au.

Puji tongtong Jahowa tongon
pardear gabei parholong atei sadokahni in;
pardear gabei in parholong atei in.

Ingat tongtong, ale tonduyhon.
Ganup na jenges, ibahen Tuhan Naibata hubam;
Dear layak-Ni do na pagoluhkon ho.

Ungkab labah na majenges rumah ni Naibatakin;
Ai hujin do au maringgas bani ari Minggu in.
Hupindahi do ijin bohi ni Naibatangkin.

Togu hanai on, na mardousa on;
Ale Jesus Tuhannami, sai maidop ham bannami.
Togu ham tongtong na mardousa on.

Sai parorot Ham, ganup hanai on;
Humbai ganup munsuh nami, ulang magou be hanami;
Sai parorot Ham, ganup hanai on.

Sai urasi Ham ganup hanai on;
As mubah uhurnami, sai borsih ma tonduynami.
Sai urasi Ham ganup hanai on.

Sai ajari ham ganup hanai on;
’Se ganup botohonnami dalan sidalanannami.
Sai ajari ham ganup hanai on.

Sai pintori ham ganup hanai on;
Sai unduk ma uhurnami mansopotkon dousanami.
Sai pintori ham ganup hanai on.

Sai pamasuk Ham ganup hanai on;
Ulang modom be hanami bani pardousaon nami.
Sai puhoi Ham ganup hanai on.

Sai pamasuk ham ganup hanai on;
Bai na jumlah ajalnami anggo bois bohalnami.
Sai pamasuk Ham das hu surga in.

Ham, o Tuhan sai pagoluh, sai ajari Ham au on;
Anggoa bumbang, sai patoguh janah apoh Ham au on
Hata-Mu patorang Ham, sai tongtong bai uhurhon

Pasaud Ham ma pangajaran na nidok ni Hata-Mu;
Ham patoguh parpadanan bai ganup na roh Bamu
Sai totap urupi Ham na martonggo dompak Ham

Silang na mapansing in, ham tongtong baen gantarhin
Anggo roh hadogaskin sanggah rotap hosahkin;
Bani sitaronon in, ham tongtong baen gantarhin

Ai dao h do ari in? Tatap ma, ai domma mulgap.
Sangap ni Tuhanta in, bani bangsa in sol sogop;
Loja do na kahou in , mambalosi setan in.

Jesus roh ma Ham podas , mantaluhon hagolapan;
Sai marlintun ma doras, hata-Mu bai hajolmaon.
Ase jumpah haganup, na nidok ni hata-Mu.

Ai idop ni uhur-Mu in, pasirsir parulihan;
Ai sedo pambaennami in, ‘ge pe marhasurungan;
Sipuji diri talu do, ningon mabiar dompak Ham,
tunduk do haganupan.

Ge salpu ari bomgin in, seng roh ope layak-Ni;
Lang ra be ganggu uhurhin, bani hagogohon-Ni;
Sai tong sonai do uhur ni na dob tubuh hun babou in,
sai Naibata ijolom.

Pinahan na kahou in ipindahi si parmahan;
Bujuran do Jesus in mangindahi si pardousa;
Ase ulang magou in ipagoluh Jesus in.

Roh ganupan nasiam na pusokan uhur lalap;
Jesus do mardilo ham, ase mulak bai Jahowa;
Ulang lang porsaya da! Ipagoluh Jesus ham.

Tenger uhurhon bai Jesus, itangihon tonggongkin;
Uhurhon do tong itohu, gabe ianan-Ni in ;
Jumpah hasonangan in, ampa hatuahon in;
Puho ho, ale uhurhu, halupahon ma horumu .

Sai tatap Ham au, ‘se tambah haporsayaonku;
Togu Ham au, hu surga papintor langkahku.
Halani Anak-Mu in, Naibata.

